        "created_at": "2014-03-04T18:00:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>When Cosmonautilus is dealt damage find the square root of that damage, select that number of damage types, rounding normally, by alphabetical order starting with the last damage type Cosmonautilus was immune to, Cosmonautilus is now immune to those damage types until the next time that Cosmonautilus is dealt damage, or until Thursday, whichever smells better to the person on your left. <span></span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I am in awe.</p>\n<p><span>I am stealing the Cosmonautilus name, obviously. &nbsp;Also, that rules text is best thing I have seen this week.</span></p>",
