      {
        "id": 88247,
        "name": "holycrapihavemail",
        "username": "holycrapihavemail",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/53a042/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-05T23:56:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wonder if the reptilian guy with the crystal is an Atlantean.&nbsp; I'd assumed we'd see an Atlantean show up at some point, either a hero or villain, since their ruins are an environement.&nbsp; The ruins have things like autoturrets and crystal spires, which makes me think that floaty-crystal-guy could be a candidate.</p><p>...or, maybe the set will simply have four alien villains.&nbsp; That would be cool too.&nbsp; If they are, I wonder if they'll act as GSF tie-ins.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 77,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:12:50.168Z",
