      {
        "id": 88248,
        "name": "Edwin",
        "username": "Edwin",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-06T22:18:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think four random aliens would be pretty lame.&nbsp; But if he's an Atlantean I'd be extremely happy.&nbsp; I was trying to think of how he could be anything other than a Voss clone (in the sense that Mongul and Annihilus and Darkseid and Imperiex and god knows who else are all not really all that different, being different races of alien doesn't change the fact that they're pretty much all just omnicidal alien conquerors who differ only in particulars of appearance and powers and such, seldom having much in the way of personality and <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/AtlantisIsBoring\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">nothing relatable in terms of backstory</a>), and this is a much better idea than anything I came up with.&nbsp; I hope you're right.</p>",
